# a musician's ear over a long run: a whole day (Day length 30 min) under every preset. Every note sung is in the
# office's mode and in tune; no two voices a second, a tritone or a seventh apart (the ison, a held final like the
# drone, aside); no mistake of 1.1's kinds happens; none of it clips
tap GLO
spin K1 -2
tap HOME
wait 2000
expect preset 0
peakreset
wait 1800000
expect peak_db_max -1
expect offmode 0
expect offtune 0
expect clash 0
expect gone 0
turn PRESET 1
expect preset 1
peakreset
wait 1800000
expect peak_db_max -1
expect offmode 0
expect offtune 0
expect clash 0
expect gone 0
turn PRESET 1
expect preset 2
peakreset
wait 1800000
